# A slow boot (source/ezkernelnew.c, Boot_notice_check): LOGGING on and a
# card without a log, whose 64 KB file takes about 80 frames to make. The
# "Loading..." notice comes up 20 frames after the card mounted, coming in
# from black as it rises (B19, E9), then fades out before home comes in,
# every frame of both fades hashed (v0.3.2: it cut in, after a frame of the
# background, and cut out). A fast boot shows none (golden boot).
#! settings 26=2
-w "boot: still busy 20 frames after mounting"
-H @0:@12
-w "screen ready: notice"
-s @1:notice.png
-w "boot: handing over"
-H @0:@6
-w "screen ready: home"
-s @1:home.png
